ES:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}¿Cómo andas?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Veo que sigues disfrutando
de la nieve, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hola, ci si rivede, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Ti piace ancora {{TAG:0005:0005:}} sotto
tutta questa neve, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Yine selam, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Bu kadar karın içindeki {{TAG:0005:0005:}}'ı
hâlâ beğeniyor musun, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}So {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}I see you're NOT carrying an
umbrella. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}But isn't that what's
all trendy right now?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Well, I wouldn't worry about it.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Trends are for trendy people.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
No one likes them, right?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Veo {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}que no llevas paraguas.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¿No sabes que es la última moda?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Se nota que no lees mi blog...

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Oh, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}vedo che sei senza ombrello...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Ho sentito che è molto fashion e
io vado pazzo per le cose trendy.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Beh, un tipo ganzo come me{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
non può mica restare indifferente
alle ultime tendenze delle moda, no?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Demek {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}şemsiye TAŞIMIYORSUN. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Ama şu sıralar moda olan bu değil mi?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Neyse, ben olsam kafaya takmazdım.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Trendler, trend insanları içindir.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Zaten onları kim sever, değil mi?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Fishing? {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Today? {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Yeah, makes sense.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}You're always doing your own thing.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}That's why you're awesome.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Te vas de pesca? ¿Hoy?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0015:}}
¡Lo único que vas a pescar hoy
va a ser un resfriado!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Balık mı tutacaksın? {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Bugün mü? {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
Evet, sana yakışır.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Sen hep bildiğini okuyorsun.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Zaten seni harika yapan da bu.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Questa neve non finisce mai...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}In effetti, però, la città imbiancata
è proprio bella. Que bonita!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Dieser Schnee hört wohl nie auf...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Aber irgendwie ist unsere Stadt ja
ganz schön in Weiß, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Bu kar hiç dinmeyecek galiba, değil mi? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Neyse, kasabamız kar altında güzel görünüyor,
{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}o yüzden sorun yok.
